          "explanationKey": "What are the two parts of the U.S. Congress?",
          "facts": [
            "Congress has two parts: the Senate and the House of Representatives.",
            "The House of Representatives has 435 voting members.",
            "Both parts meet in the U.S. Capitol in Washington, D.C."
          ],
          "newWords": [
            {
              "word": "Senate",
              "meaning": "one part of Congress, with 100 senators"
